Author: Matthijs van Henten <[REDACTED-EMAIL]>
Date:   Fri Sep 25 22:39:27 2026 +0000

    fix(web): pinch, pan and pan tool on touch without losing strokes

    Root cause: a second finger during a touch stroke discarded the stroke but left the surface stuck in Draw mode, so every later move was ignored and pinch or pan never reached the camera.

    Pointer handling moves into a tested gesture state machine: two fingers pinch around the midpoint and pan together, a toolbar pan tool makes one finger pan, touch and Safari gesture events are blocked on the canvas, and a zero-spread pinch or non-finite camera is ignored.

